<title>SOUTH KOREA: Lotte Chilsung Beverage 1996 net falls.</title>
<headline>Lotte Chilsung Beverage 1996 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>	 (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)					221    vs 410</p>
<p>    Net						0.31 vs   0.56</p>
<p>Dividend (pct, par 5,000 won)</p>
<p>     common shares				    5 vs   8</p>
<p>     preferred shares				 6 vs   9</p>
<p>    Turnover				     631.65 vs 605.47</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			    1.09 vs   1.87</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries		     0.34 (loss) vs 0.93 (gain)</p>
<p>    Div Register					Dec 31</p>
<p>    Div Payment				    from Mar 27</p>
<p>NOTE - Lotte Chilsung Beverage Co is South Korea's largest non-alcoholic beverage maker.</p>
<p>-- Seoul newsroom (822) 727 5649</p>
</text>
